{"id":"3c6d89bc622365e0","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection.md","title":"Theorem — Hom-set Bijection of an Adjunction","display":"Theorem — Hom-set Bijection of an Adjunction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection","aliases":["14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection"],"display":"Theorem — Hom-set Bijection of an Adjunction","depends_on":["[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-morphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Hom-set Bijection of an Adjunction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to GF\">\\(\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to GF\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon:FG\\to1_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\varepsilon:FG\\to1_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span> 为满足两条三角恒等式的单位/余单位（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{A,B}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B)\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B)),\\qquad\\Phi_{A,B}(h)\\coloneqq G(h)\\circ\\eta_A,\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,B}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B))\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B),\\qquad\\Psi_{A,B}(k)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon_B\\circ F(k),\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,B}\\circ\\Phi_{A,B}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B)},\\qquad\n\\Phi_{A,B}\\circ\\Psi_{A,B}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B))}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{A,B}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B)\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B)),\\qquad\\Phi_{A,B}(h)\\coloneqq G(h)\\circ\\eta_A,\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,B}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B))\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B),\\qquad\\Psi_{A,B}(k)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon_B\\circ F(k),\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,B}\\circ\\Phi_{A,B}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B)},\\qquad\n\\Phi_{A,B}\\circ\\Psi_{A,B}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B))}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries，公式 (8)–(13)，印刷页 18–19；DjVu 第 15 图页。对第一复合，用余单位对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的自然性将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_BFG(h)\">\\(\\varepsilon_BFG(h)\\)</span> 换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\varepsilon_{F(A)}\">\\(h\\varepsilon_{F(A)}\\)</span>，再用三角恒等式消去；另一复合对称。它们对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的前合成与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的后合成都自然，给出伴随的 Hom 形式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$，$\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to GF$、$\\varepsilon:FG\\to1_{\\mathcal D}$ 为满足两条三角恒等式的单位/余单位（[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]）。$A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$、$B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to GF","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon:FG\\to1_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{A,B}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B)\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B)),\\qquad\\Phi_{A,B}(h)\\coloneqq G(h)\\circ\\eta_A,\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,B}:\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B))\\to\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B),\\qquad\\Psi_{A,B}(k)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon_B\\circ F(k),\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,B}\\circ\\Phi_{A,B}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),B)},\\qquad\n\\Phi_{A,B}\\circ\\Psi_{A,B}=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,G(B))}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_BFG(h)","display":false},{"tex":"h\\varepsilon_{F(A)}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1576,"backlinks":[{"id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"单位与余单位满足两条三角恒等式，等价于 Hom 集的自然双射；见 [[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection]]。恒等函子与函子复合在 [[14-df-identity-composite-functors]] 内建。"},{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection|Theorem — Hom-set Bijection of an Adjunction]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection|Theorem — Hom-set Bijection of an Adjunction]]"},{"id":"b6affdb837eb529f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c9318ee07cf41c8b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d2b4e5cf16585f95","5c5452002ba29fda"]}